# rpmlint filters. Each one states why the finding cannot be satisfied.

# The words are a file name extension (the tcc-guard configuration file
# /etc/asus-ux8406-tcc-guard.toml), parts of package names
# (asus-zenbook-duo-ux8406-keyboard-bpf, iio-sensor-proxy), and names of
# products (KWin, Wayland, Plasma, emoji); none can be spelled differently,
# and the descriptions need them to tell the reader what to configure or
# install.
addFilter(r"spelling-error .*'(toml|bpf|iio|kwin|wayland|plasma|emoji|touchscreen)'")
